# Pieces of what the target for the table of rules and the cascade is
# given: of the selectors that make a table, and of the lines that stand
# for a document. Given to the fuzzing engine (tools/fuzz.py), which would
# be a long time coming to them by changing bytes. One piece a line, in
# quotes.

# Between the sheets, and the lines of a document
"\x00"
"\x0a<"
"\x0a>\x0a"
"<p\x0a"
"<div|class|a b\x0a"
"|class|"
"|id|"
"|style|"
"|lang|en-GB"
"|epub:type|"
"|hidden|"

# Selectors
" > "
" + "
" "
", "
"*"
".first"
"#end"
"::first-letter"
":link"
"[hidden]"
"[epub|type~=\"note\"]"
"[*|"
"~="
"|="
"^="
"$="
"*="
" i]"

# What a rule sets
" { float: left }\x0a"
" { margin: 0 1px }\x0a"
"{ width: 99999px }"
"font-family: A, \"b c\";"
"text-indent: 1.5em;"
" !important"
"@media not amzn-mobi {"
"}"
